MODIFIED SOFTWARE NOTICE

This is a modified project, not an unmodified upstream release.
Modifications and additions include the Windows Tencent Chinese-client
control flow, random-deck mastery/reward loop, 567 and hog strategy work,
process ownership and recovery, durable battle/evidence records,
Chinese desktop controls, a WPF JSONL backend/frontend, a share edition
with installation-owned data paths and first-use settings, and associated
tests and build/development tools. See the source and RELEASE_NOTES.md
for the public release scope. The maintainer does not claim sole authorship
of the upstream code, templates, or third-party materials.

